{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_sve3bb77cb-p1", "markdown": "# Page 9810 of 10444\n\nFrom:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7XC)\n\n@uscp.gov>\n\nDate: January 1, 2021 at 10:02:05 PM EST\n\nTo: (bx6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nCIDIỊi\n\n(b)(6);\n\n@usss.dhs.gov>\n\nSubject: 12.30.20\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7XC)\n\nGood evening by Hope you enjoyed a happy and healthy new year. Below please find a report submitted to the FBI for your visibility:\n\nNew iSalute Message-\n\nTime of Submission: 2020/12/30 05:00:32\n\nCategory: Other (Informational Information)\n\nDescription: Hello my name is Sergeant\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7ХC)\n\nand I am a DACP Desk Sergeant\n\nwith the Ft. Leonard Wood Military Police. And during my shift I received a phone call at the Military Police Desk from a\n\n(bX6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nHe was wanting to report that he\n\nhad a hunch that on January 6, 2021 that there would be a chemical or biological attack in a water reservoir in Washington D.C. and that there should be extra security at the inauguration. I would like to make sure that this gets reported/known.\n\nSubmitter Information-\n\n(bx6):\n\nFirst Name:\n\nMiddle Name: (0X6)\n\nLast Name:\n\n(b)(6);\n\n(b)(7)(C)\n\nCitizenship: Cuzen\n\nPrimary Phone:\n\nPrimary Phone Type: Cellular\n\nAlternate Phone:\n\nAlternate Phone Type:\n\nCity/Base: FT. Leonard Wood\n\nState/Country: Missouri\n\nEmail Address:\n\nSpecial Agent\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7XC)\n\nUnited States Capitol Police\n\nCriminal Investigations Section\n\nFBI Cyber Task Force Officer\n\nOffice:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nPrimary: (bX6): (b)(7X(C) @uscp.goV\n\n(b)(6);\n\nAlternate_(bic) @fbi.gov", "width": 1700, "height": 2200, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "Page 9810 of 10444", "bbox": {"x": 760.6469000404313, "y": -3.716200680514703e-08, "width": 178.70619946091634, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "From:", "bbox": {"x": 284.09703431491465, "y": 210.83333310416663, "width": 87.06199460916439, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "tex